    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to &quot;Air Attack&quot;, an arcade avia/auto simulator! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take personal control of a fighter/armored vehicle, perform various missions, upgrade the equipment available. Explore the territory, capture all enemy bases. Your motto: &quot;Only one will remain!&quot;<br>Exciting aerial and ground battles await you, an upgrade system for all available vehicles, a dangerous enemy, and an adrenaline rush! <br>- Territory Reconnaissance; <br>- Air/ground battles; <br>- Capturing enemy bases; <br>- Equipment upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Virtual reality (VR) helmets are supported.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to &quot;Air Attack&quot;, an arcade avia/auto simulator! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take personal control of a fighter/armored vehicle, perform various missions, upgrade the equipment available. Explore the territory, capture all enemy bases. Your motto: &quot;Only one will remain!&quot;<br>Exciting aerial and ground battles await you, an upgrade system for all available vehicles, a dangerous enemy, and an adrenaline rush! <br>- Territory Reconnaissance; <br>- Air/ground battles; <br>- Capturing enemy bases; <br>- Equipment upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Virtual reality (VR) helmets are supported.</p>",
